      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "1. User logs in → Keycloak issues JWT with user claims\n2. App stores JWT in session (Redis)\n3. User sends message → Agent retrieves JWT → Calls Portkey with JWT in Authorization header\n4. Portkey validates JWT (JWKS signature + claims) → Applies AIRS policies based on user/groups\n5. Agent uses MCP tools if needed → Response flows back to user",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. User logs in → Keycloak issues JWT with user claims\n2. App stores JWT in session (Redis)\n3. User sends message → Agent retrieves JWT → Calls Portkey with JWT in Authorization header\n4. Portkey validates JWT (JWKS signature + claims) → Applies AIRS policies based on user/groups\n5. Agent uses MCP tools if needed → Response flows back to user",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 78
    }
  ],
